.TH SELKIE 1
.SH NAME
selkie \- native desktop client for Podman, built with Rust and GPUI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B selkie
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B selkie
is a small desktop application for the local Podman engine. It drives the
.B podman
CLI and lists containers, images, volumes, networks, secrets, pods, compose
projects, machines and connections, with logs, live stats, an interactive terminal, a
dashboard and the usual resource actions.
.PP
Launching it again while it is running raises the existing window and exits.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/selkie/settings.json
Window geometry, panel widths, theme and the selected connection.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/applications/selkie.desktop
Desktop entry installed by the user-level installer; the Debian package puts
the same file in /usr/share/applications instead.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR podman (1)
